                <p>Source: National Archives, RG 84, Athens Embassy Files: Lot 78 F 134, Greece,
                    1974, Box 39, POL 14 ELECTIONS 1974. Secret. Repeated to London. Drafted and
                    approved by Tasca.</p>
            </note>
